    "description": {
      "value": "You combine a blazing inferno and air currents into a fiery vortex. You can Cast this Spell only if you are outside or the ceiling is 40 feet or higher. All squares in the vortex are 3 for flying creatures.\n\nAll creatures in the area take 3d4 bludgeoning damage and 3d6 fire damage as gusts of fiery wind buffet them, with a basic Reflex save. Each time you Sustain the Spell, you can move the whirlwind up to 20 feet in a straight line. Each creature the whirlwind moves through takes the damage with a basic Reflex save. A creature can take damage from a flame vortex only once per round."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+2): The vortex deals an additional 1d4 bludgeoning damage and 1d6 fire damage."
    },
